{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:38:49+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:38:49+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Bunzl plc","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Food Distribution","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.bunzl.com","employees":26777,"summary":"Bunzl plc operates as a distribution and services company in the North America, Continental Europe, the United Kingdom, Ireland, and internationally. It provides personal protection and safety equipment, including gloves, boots, hard hats, ear and eye protection, other workwear, as well as cleaning and hygiene supplies and asset protection products; and healthcare consumables, such as gloves, masks, swabs, gowns, bandages, healthcare devices, and other healthcare related equipment. The company also offers cleaning and hygiene materials comprising chemicals and hygiene paper; goods-not-for-resale, including food packaging, films, labels, and other store supplies; non-food consumables, such as food packaging, disposable tableware, guest amenities, catering equipment, and agricultural supplies; and other products. It serves its products to industrial, construction, e-commerce, hospitals, care homes and other facilities serving the healthcare, public sector customers, grocery stores, supermarkets, convenience stores, hotels, restaurants, contract caterers, food processors, commercial growers, leisure, retail customers, and office supply companies. Bunzl plc was founded in 1854 and is based in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Bunzl plc opère en tant que société de distribution et de services en Amérique du Nord, en Europe continentale, au Royaume-Uni, en Irlande et à l'international. Il fournit des équipements de protection personnelle et de sécurité, y compris des gants, des bottes, des casques, des protections des oreilles et des yeux, d'autres vêtements de travail, ainsi que des fournitures de nettoyage et d'hygiène et des produits de protection des actifs; et des consommables de soins de santé, tels que des gants, des masques, des écouvillons, des blouses, des bandages, des appareils de soins de santé et d'autres équipements liés aux soins de santé. La société propose également des produits de nettoyage et d'hygiène comprenant des produits chimiques et du papier d'hygiène; des produits non revendus, y compris des emballages alimentaires, des films, des étiquettes et d'autres fournitures de magasin; des consommables non alimentaires, tels que des emballages alimentaires, de la vaisselle jetable, des équipements pour invités, du matériel de restauration et des fournitures agricoles; et d'autres produits.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":8728881152,"shares_outstanding":313537365,"trailing_pe":18.437086,"forward_pe":14.148355,"price_to_book":315.82532,"ev_to_ebitda":11.244,"ev_to_revenue":0.926,"dividend_yield":0.026600001,"payout_ratio":0.4907,"beta_yahoo":0.322},"targets":{"current_price":2784.0,"mean":2793.0,"median":2830.0,"high":3600.0,"low":2050.0,"n_analysts":18,"reco_mean":2.94444,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-09-01"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-11-12","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.01307,"institutions_pct":0.75962996,"institutions_float_pct":0.7697,"institutions_n":390,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0008,"shares":247713,"value":689632992,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.1375}],"funds":[{"name":"HARRIS ASSOCIATES INVESTMENT TRUST-Oakmark International Fund","pct":0.024300002,"shares":7680329,"value":21382035936,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0626},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0149,"shares":4710745,"value":13114714080,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0018000001},{"na